        "Content": "Leonard Wilson keenan \r\n\r\nOur Business is you.\r\n\r\n2 Bedroom, 2 Bathroom, Top Floor Apartment \r\nAcross from green space \r\n\r\nRichard Todd and Leonard Wilson keenan are delighted to present 12F North Street Ongar to the Dublin 15 Property Market. \r\nA beautifully presented and recently refreshed two-bedroom, two-bathroom top-floor apartment, ideally located in the popular and convenient area of Ongar. The property has been fully repainted throughout and benefits from new carpets, updated bathrooms, two private balconies and parking.\r\n\r\nOn entering the apartment, you are greeted by a large, bright entrance hallway which immediately gives a sense of the spacious accommodation on offer. To the right is the first generous double bedroom, which is bright and sunny and benefits from fitted wardrobes providing excellent storage.\r\n\r\nMoving through the apartment, you will find the recently refreshed family bathroom, before continuing into the impressive primary bedroom. This is a spacious and bright room which benefits from fitted wardrobes, a private en-suite and its own balcony, providing the perfect space to relax and unwind.\r\n\r\nThe main living accommodation is centred around a large, bright and spacious open-plan lounge, kitchen and dining area. The kitchen offers an abundance of both base and eye-level storage, while the generous living and dining space provides an excellent area for both everyday living and entertaining. Double doors lead from the lounge onto a second private balcony, while the large windows and doors flood the entire area with natural light.\r\n\r\nThe apartment has been recently updated and refreshed throughout, including full redecoration and new carpets, creating a bright and modern home ready for immediate occupation.\r\n\r\nLocated in Ongar, the property is within easy reach of a wide selection of local amenities, including shops, cafés, restaurants, pharmacies and other everyday conveniences. There is a good choice of primary and secondary schools in the surrounding area, while the property is also well served by public transport, with a number of Dublin Bus routes operating locally and Hansfield Railway Station within easy reach.\r\n\r\nBlanchardstown Centre is approximately 3–3.5km away and offers an extensive range of shops, restaurants, cafés, leisure facilities and services. The location also provides convenient access to the M50, N3 and Dublin City Centre, making this an ideal home for commuters.\r\n\r\nThis is a fantastic opportunity to acquire a spacious and well-presented top-floor apartment in a popular Dublin 15 location, offering bright and generously proportioned accommodation, two balconies, parking and excellent local amenities.\r\n\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
